    {
      "id": "en.n10.class-68.t01",
      "en": "My point is that cities need more bike lanes.",
      "es": "Mi punto es que las ciudades necesitan más carriles bici.",
      "explanationEs": "El punto es tu postura, dicha en una sola frase y al principio.",
      "segments": [
        "My point is that cities",
        "need more bike lanes."
      ],
      "audioText": "My point is that cities need more bike lanes.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n10-spontaneous-speaking-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n10.class-68.t02",
      "en": "The main reason is that they make streets safer.",
      "es": "La razón principal es que hacen las calles más seguras.",
      "explanationEs": "La razón explica por qué piensas así: The main reason is that…",
      "segments": [
        "The main reason is that",
        "they make streets safer."
      ],
      "audioText": "The main reason is that they make streets safer.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n10-spontaneous-speaking-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n10.class-68.t03",
      "en": "For example, accidents fell in my neighbourhood after the new lane opened.",
      "es": "Por ejemplo, los accidentes bajaron en mi barrio después de abrir el nuevo carril.",
      "explanationEs": "El ejemplo apoya la razón con un caso concreto.",
      "segments": [
        "For example, accidents fell in my",
        "neighbourhood after the new lane opened."
      ],
      "audioText": "For example, accidents fell in my neighbourhood after the new lane opened.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n10-spontaneous-speaking-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n10.class-68.t04",
      "en": "In conclusion, bike lanes are worth the space they take.",
      "es": "En conclusión, los carriles bici valen el espacio que ocupan.",
      "explanationEs": "El cierre repite tu punto con otras palabras.",
      "segments": [
        "In conclusion, bike lanes are",
        "worth the space they take."
      ],
      "audioText": "In conclusion, bike lanes are worth the space they take.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n10-spontaneous-speaking-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n10.class-68.t05",
      "en": "Sorry, I'm rambling; let me go back to my point.",
      "es": "Perdón, estoy divagando; vuelvo a mi punto.",
      "explanationEs": "Reconocer un desvío y volver al punto evita perder el orden.",
      "segments": [
        "Sorry, I'm rambling; let me",
